        "TileImage": "$($repository 3250f14e-f1e2-4f0a-865a-c8de2e399a81).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47,\r\rlast week, our ICA-analysts have intercepted various phone calls between several Providence operatives and prominent individuals, all referring to themselves by the cryptic codename &quot;Nexus&quot;.\r\rWe suspect that Nexus is a Providence-affiliated sister group, which you have been cleared to eliminate.\r\rYour first target is Duchess Mette II von Podenphant, a German aristocrat and a high ranking member of Nexus. You must also eliminate her cousin, Lady Martha Mendoza.\r\rGood luck.",
